"1155: SME MEDIUM | Media | MediaDive (https://mediadive.dsmz.de/medium/1155?bacdive=4194&mobile=1)\nciteturn40search0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 4 days ago; ## Image: DSMZ Medium 1155 . ... [Input]  | KJ\n(1 mg/ml)  | 50.00  | µl\n\n## Image: DSMZ Medium 1155 . SME MEDIUM\n\nWhat is this page?\n\n##### Selected strain: Thermodiscus maritimus DSM 15173\n\nThis strain uses the standard medium without modifications.\n\nGrowth conditions: 90 °C\n\nEquipment needed:\n\n* * *\n\nFinal gas composition: 80 % H2 20 % CO2 read more\n\n* * *\n\nFinal pH: 5.5\n\n | Compound  | Amount  | Unit\n--- | --- | --- | ---\n[Input]  | NaCl  | 27.70  | g\n[Input]  | MgSO_{4} x 7 H_{2}O  | 7.00  | g\n[Input]  | MgCl_{2} x 6 H_{2}O  | 5.50  | g\n[Input]  | KH_{2}PO_{4}  | 1.00  | g\n[Input]  | CaCl_{2} x 2 H_{2}O  | 0.75  | g\n[Input]  | KCl  | 0.66  | g\n[Input]  | (NH_{4})_{2}SO_{4}  | 0.50  | g\n[Input]  | NaBr  | 0.10  | g\n[Input]  | H_{3}BO_{3}  | 30.00  | mg\n[Input]  | SrCl2 x 6 H_{2}O  | 15.00  | mg\n[Input]  | KJ\n(1 mg/ml)  | 50.00  | µl\n[Input]  | Elemental sulfur  | 10.00  | g\n[Input]  | Double distilled water  | 1000.00  | ml\n[Input]  | Na_{2}S , used for reduction of the medium\n(2.5 %)  | 20.00  | ml\n[Input]  | Yeast extract  | 0.04  | %\n1 Reduction of the medium by addition of 20 ml Na_{2}S (2.5%); then adjust pH to 5.5 with sulfuric acid.\n2 Gas phase: H_{2}/CO_{2}=80/20 (250 kPa).\n3 After autoclaving add 0.04% yeast extract.\n4 Incubation at 90°C for 1-2 days.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBiological effects of trans, trans-farnesol in Leishmania amazonensis (https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/cellular-and-infection-microbiology/articles/10.3389/fcimb.2023.1221246/pdf)\nciteturn40search12 [wordlim: 200] Published: 3.0 years ago; 60, 41–50. doi: 10.4269/ajtmh.1999.60.41\nJones, T. M. (2016). The Lutzomyia longipalpis complex: a brief natural history of\naggregation-sex pheromone communication. Parasit Vectors 